# Enforce LF everywhere, binary-safe handling for assets
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.db binary
*.lockb binary
